{"unit_id":"a307608689-afk__dsh-session-trash#card-zh","repo":"a307608689-afk/dsh-session-trash","commit":"5cab1b60f5a9bcd11f09c65edec6d4e2bae69953","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-trash 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话回收站插件，在会话菜单和设置页接入删除、恢复与管理界面。删除前可查看会话信息并确认，随后将会话移入回收站；用户可恢复会话、批量处理条目或彻底删除，也可查看和管理留档、处理孤儿会话目录。插件还提供会话导出和留档还原功能，适合希望降低误删影响并整理本地会话文件的 DSH 用户。数据保存在 DSH 本机目录中，插件通过同源接口工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-22","index.js:2018-2040","client.js:1620-1643"]}
{"unit_id":"a307608689-afk__dsh-session-trash#card-en","repo":"a307608689-afk/dsh-session-trash","commit":"5cab1b60f5a9bcd11f09c65edec6d4e2bae69953","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-trash adds a recycle bin to the DSH web client. Users can inspect and delete sessions, restore trashed sessions, manage archives, handle orphan folders, and export or import sessions. It supports reversible cleanup of locally stored DSH sessions through same-origin routes.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-22","index.js:2018-2040","client.js:1620-1643"]}
